answers.approach:
Always-on holdouts—
budget bleeds where truth is cheap;
models fill between.

Hush now, seek no magic score that says which ad was true;
Keep spend and outcomes somewhere safe, beyond the platform’s view.

Randomize the levers still in reach—small switchbacks, cells, and time;
Pool their lift with honest bounds, not attribution dressed as rhyme.

Let MMM be one frail witness, checked by tests and drift alarms;
When buying agents change their ways, retire the model’s charms.

Publish misses, code, and benchmarks; steer only when signs agree;
Some lift will stay unproven still—no dashboard sets it free.
